 * Target path (upstream e107inc/e107 master):
 *   e107_core/override/url/news/sef_url.php
 *
 * Overrides the core profile e107_core/url/news/sef_url.php
 * ("Friendly URLs with ID"), reshaping every rule from
 *   /news/view/{id}/{slug}   to   /news/view-{id}-{slug}
 * so that URLs produced by e107-2.4.x-Lite's eplugins/news/e_url.php keep
